From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rezoss <rezoss79@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Allow Now Nudge suggested cue rendering

HoneyBoard can receive NOW_NUDGE broadcasts while still refusing to render
the cue with "skip to show suggested cue - inaccessible mode". Bypass that
local suggested-cue gate so Now Nudge can reach the strip when the keyboard
input view, textboard binding, and main input connection checks pass.

---
 smali/x9/a.smali | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali/x9/a.smali b/smali/x9/a.smali
--- a/smali/x9/a.smali
+++ b/smali/x9/a.smali
@@ -621,5 +621,5 @@
     :goto_f
-    if-eqz v0, :cond_13
+    goto :cond_13
 
     const-string p0, "inaccessible mode"
 
